WEBVTT

00:13:25.957 --> 00:13:32.924
The condition of branding has always
reflected the condition of our culture.

00:13:33.699 --> 00:13:35.786
It is our responsibility

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:40.791
to continue to leverage
the democratic power branding provides,

00:13:40.815 --> 00:13:42.734
and it is our responsibility

00:13:43.654 --> 00:13:45.720
to design a culture that reflects

00:13:46.911 --> 00:13:48.307
and honors

00:13:49.317 --> 00:13:51.190
the kind of world we want to live in.

00:13:51.741 --> 00:13:52.906
Thank you.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:56.249
(Applause)